==== OEM easy installation ====

You must set your TCP/IP v4 protocol to:
  - IP: 192.168.1.2
  - Netmask: 255.255.255.0
  - Gateway: 192.168.1.1
  - DNS: (optional, can be blank).
Then:
  - Power off the router.
  - Press //REG// button.
  - Keep it pressed while powering up during ~50+ seconds.
  - The power led changes green to red color.
  - Access to http://192.168.1.1, you should see this screen: {{media:sagem:sagem_fast2404_recovery.png?100|}} 
  - Upload binary file
  - Wait until router reboots.

