===== Notes =====
After flashing the router with OpenWrt the router was not working. e.g. No telnet access to 192.168.1.1, no Luci http access.

By connecting via a serial port you will be able to open a console. There you must execute "firstboot". After this step OpenWrt is working as expected.

Backfire 10.03.1 does not boot at all. Problem with the flash. http://downloads.openwrt.org/backfire/10.03.1/brcm63xx/openwrt-F%40ST2404-squashfs-cfe.bin 

Attitude Adjustment 12.09 boots correctly after executing "firstboot". Memory is low.  http://downloads.openwrt.org/attitude_adjustment/12.09/brcm63xx/generic/openwrt-F%40ST2404-squashfs-cfe.bin

